WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:34.068
[Episode 27]

01:35.319 --> 01:38.000
Father, even if I say it a million times,

01:38.000 --> 01:39.879
I want to be with my teacher.

01:39.879 --> 01:41.319
We truly love each other.

01:41.319 --> 01:44.120
Our family has been upright for generations.

01:44.120 --> 01:45.760
You read poetry and books
and learned etiquette,

01:45.760 --> 01:49.079
not to use them to defy human ethics.

01:49.079 --> 01:52.680
If your dear teacher truly liked you,

01:52.680 --> 01:56.319
how could he
personally recommend you as empress?

01:56.319 --> 01:58.159
He must have his reasons.

01:58.159 --> 02:02.040
He promised
that even if he faces public criticism,

02:02.040 --> 02:05.000
- he will still grow old with me.
- Wake up!

02:05.000 --> 02:07.760
- Master!
- Zhi Li.

02:11.879 --> 02:14.000
This is the first time

02:15.280 --> 02:18.639
you have ever slapped me.

02:19.560 --> 02:21.439
Master, Zhi Li.

02:21.439 --> 02:24.360
Both of you, calm down.

02:24.360 --> 02:28.039
Zhi Li, your father
has devoted his life to the country.

02:28.039 --> 02:30.800
When has he ever pursued personal gains?

02:30.800 --> 02:32.759
He is afraid that you will make a mistake

02:32.759 --> 02:35.199
and regret it for the rest of your life.

02:37.159 --> 02:40.199
Mother, since no one cares about my feelings,

02:40.199 --> 02:42.439
I have to plan for myself.

02:42.439 --> 02:44.280
I'm going to see His Majesty now.

02:44.280 --> 02:46.159
- His Majesty has his own ways.
- Stop her!

02:46.159 --> 02:47.879
- Zhi Li.
- Stop this unfilial daughter.

02:47.879 --> 02:51.479
Before the Announcement Ceremony,
you are not to step out of your room.

02:51.479 --> 02:53.080
Move aside.

02:54.319 --> 02:56.039
Zhi Li.

02:56.039 --> 02:59.400
If you step out this door,
you'll get the entire family into trouble.

02:59.400 --> 03:01.960
I don't want you to become a sinner.

03:02.879 --> 03:07.159
I thought only Zhi Li could
stand alongside His Majesty.

03:07.159 --> 03:10.479
I even used the Mandate Token
to force His Majesty.

03:10.479 --> 03:12.280
I never expected...

03:12.280 --> 03:15.599
How can I face His Majesty?

03:15.599 --> 03:19.439
How can I face our ancestors?

03:25.319 --> 03:27.039
After extensive investigation,

03:27.039 --> 03:29.639
this character definitely
refers to the surname Gu.

03:29.639 --> 03:33.479
Although Dou Kou can testify
that Gu Qin killed his wife and father,

03:33.479 --> 03:37.000
we still have no solid evidence
of his collusion with Ling Yun Fei.

03:37.000 --> 03:39.719
Justice eventually comes.

03:39.719 --> 03:44.000
When I hunted down the Society with Di Nian,
I discovered something unexpected.

03:44.000 --> 03:46.240
Tomorrow is Gu Qin's birthday,

03:46.240 --> 03:49.280
so let's give him a surprise gift.

03:51.800 --> 03:53.719
Also,

03:53.719 --> 03:55.840
after he pleads guilty and gets executed,

03:55.840 --> 03:58.919
I will immediately
handle the whole empress thing.

03:58.919 --> 04:01.159
Your Majesty.

04:01.159 --> 04:03.360
There is something I don't get.

04:03.360 --> 04:06.280
Grand Tutor Shen
has always understood Your Majesty best,

04:06.280 --> 04:08.960
and he never
kept a very tight rein on Zhi Li.

04:08.960 --> 04:12.759
Why would he
insist on making Zhi Li the empress?

04:12.759 --> 04:16.560
And that day, outside the Imperial Study,

04:17.360 --> 04:20.639
I also saw your inner struggles.

04:20.639 --> 04:23.399
Was it because of what the Grand Tutor said?

04:26.160 --> 04:28.000
Trust me.

04:28.000 --> 04:31.680
I have never been indecisive about you.

04:31.680 --> 04:34.040
No matter what happens in the future,

04:34.040 --> 04:37.519
I'll clear all obstacles for you in advance.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.600
Your Majesty,

04:42.600 --> 04:45.160
what I desire

04:45.160 --> 04:47.199
has never been the title as an empress,

04:47.199 --> 04:49.839
but a position of power.

04:49.839 --> 04:52.040
Zhi Li was recommended to be empress

04:52.040 --> 04:54.680
and had to leave the Censorate.

04:54.680 --> 04:57.079
I feel terrible about it.

04:57.079 --> 05:00.360
If I became empress, I wouldn't be myself.

05:00.360 --> 05:03.920
I also have to give up my aspirations.

05:03.920 --> 05:06.800
I believe Your Majesty knows
how to weigh and handle it,

05:06.800 --> 05:08.360
but it's too difficult for Your Majesty

05:08.360 --> 05:09.920
to confront the two chancellors,

05:09.920 --> 05:11.839
all the court officials,

05:11.839 --> 05:15.040
and even the Grand Tutor.

05:15.040 --> 05:17.560
Perhaps we should take a step back

05:17.560 --> 05:19.920
and return to a professional relationship.

05:19.920 --> 05:23.879
For both Your Majesty and me,

05:23.879 --> 05:27.240
it might be the best choice for now.

05:28.040 --> 05:31.759
Difficult? Even so, should we just give up?

05:31.759 --> 05:33.720
It's not like you.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.439
And it's not like me either.

05:35.439 --> 05:37.639
I have promised you.

05:37.639 --> 05:40.879
I wish for you to accompany me
through all seasons and festivals.

05:40.879 --> 05:43.240
I will not break any promises

05:44.399 --> 05:46.920
to you ever.

06:10.480 --> 06:13.000
Are you Mo Yu Han of the Blood Moon Society?

06:13.000 --> 06:14.879
Yes.

06:14.879 --> 06:16.519
I'm Zhao Hui, envoy of Beijian,

06:16.519 --> 06:20.360
sent by our ruler for the grand cause.

06:26.399 --> 06:28.000
Tell your ruler

06:28.000 --> 06:31.800
the Blood Moon Society
does not welcome Beijian.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.279
Who exactly are you?

06:53.279 --> 06:55.720
How dare you impersonate me
and kill the envoy

06:55.720 --> 06:58.399
to frame the Blood Moon Society!

07:07.319 --> 07:09.319
Shen Zhi Shu.

07:09.319 --> 07:13.120
You'll never restore your country.

07:13.120 --> 07:16.360
Kill them all. Leave no one alive!

08:41.039 --> 08:45.399
As expected of Ying Gua's lackey,
what a loser!

09:16.416 --> 09:20.052
[Decency]

09:26.360 --> 09:28.159
Young master.

09:45.360 --> 09:48.840
The stupidest thing is
to go on a hunger strike.

09:48.840 --> 09:52.360
It only hurts the people
who care about you most.

09:52.360 --> 09:55.320
Father made your favorite
sweet and sour ribs.

09:55.320 --> 09:56.879
Give it a try.

09:56.879 --> 09:59.840
You all claim to care about me,

09:59.840 --> 10:02.039
but has anyone ever asked

10:03.080 --> 10:05.600
whether my heart hurts?

10:08.039 --> 10:09.679
Then put your hand on your chest

10:09.679 --> 10:13.679
and ask if you have the faintest suspicion.

10:13.679 --> 10:16.840
- And Dou Kou--
- Enough.

10:16.840 --> 10:20.360
I believe what my eyes and ears report.

10:24.360 --> 10:26.080
Zhi Li,

10:27.600 --> 10:30.399
you can choose not to trust anyone,

10:31.240 --> 10:35.120
but can you just trust me this once?

10:35.120 --> 10:38.840
No one wants you to be happy more than I do.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.840
Nian,

10:46.879 --> 10:49.039
do me a favor.

10:49.039 --> 10:51.279
Let me see him.

10:51.279 --> 10:53.039
I want to hear it from him.

10:53.039 --> 10:56.200
If he has deceived me, I will give up.

11:00.840 --> 11:03.360
I would rather you hate me now

11:06.559 --> 11:11.559
than watch you jump off a cliff.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.679
Nian,

11:22.919 --> 11:25.360
the greatest suffering in this world

11:25.360 --> 11:29.799
is not love or hate, but regret.

11:42.240 --> 11:45.840
I'm holding a prince-level banquet for you,

11:45.840 --> 11:48.600
so that it's worthy of your achievements.

11:48.600 --> 11:51.960
This first cup is to celebrate your birthday.

11:54.120 --> 11:56.960
Your Majesty's great grace is unprecedented.

11:56.960 --> 12:00.639
I am deeply grateful and happy.

12:02.279 --> 12:03.840
Congratulations, Lord Gu.

12:03.840 --> 12:05.919
I have also prepared a small gift for you.

12:05.919 --> 12:07.720
It will be presented at the best time.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.360
Please wait a moment, Lord Gu.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.399
Very thoughtful of you, Director Meng.

12:11.399 --> 12:12.448
For a woman,

12:12.448 --> 12:14.840
it is rare to hold the position of Director.

12:14.840 --> 12:17.039
You also have good manners.

12:17.039 --> 12:19.320
It's quite praiseworthy.

12:22.320 --> 12:25.519
Congratulations, Lord Gu.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.039
Someone.

12:38.559 --> 12:41.120
This is the birthday gift I got for you.

12:41.120 --> 12:44.759
I believe you'll like it.

12:54.679 --> 12:57.039
Thank you, Your Majesty.

12:59.488 --> 13:03.540
[Records of Loyal Officials]

13:05.519 --> 13:07.600
Records of Loyal Officials.

13:11.200 --> 13:12.200
[Good Chancellor of Ning Empire]

13:12.200 --> 13:14.039
Your Majesty!

13:27.720 --> 13:29.480
I have an important matter to report.

13:29.480 --> 13:33.320
Your Majesty,
I should not have disturbed you,

13:33.320 --> 13:35.759
but the coronation ceremony is imminent.

13:35.759 --> 13:39.159
If I don't come today,
there will be no turning back.

13:39.159 --> 13:41.240
Rise and speak.

13:48.679 --> 13:50.360
Master.

13:52.000 --> 13:54.159
That day, you gave me a love lock

13:54.159 --> 13:55.919
and made a lifelong commitment.

13:55.919 --> 13:59.519
You asked if I could be brave for you once.

13:59.519 --> 14:01.360
Now, I want to ask

14:01.360 --> 14:04.799
if you will keep your promise.

14:13.559 --> 14:16.759
Your Majesty, I made a mistake.

14:16.759 --> 14:18.320
I failed in my teaching,

14:18.320 --> 14:22.399
causing Zhi Li
to mistake my care for her for love.

14:22.399 --> 14:24.679
It's not true at all about the love lock

14:24.679 --> 14:27.120
or commitment.

14:33.039 --> 14:35.399
It's not true?

14:35.399 --> 14:38.360
So before, you lied

14:38.360 --> 14:41.279
and gave me all those false promises?

14:42.480 --> 14:46.240
Zhi Li, I am very disappointed in you.

14:46.240 --> 14:48.919
Who exactly has tempted you

14:48.919 --> 14:51.639
to fabricate such appalling lies?

14:56.919 --> 15:01.080
You personally gave me this love lock.

15:01.080 --> 15:02.759
You engraved it with your own hands.

15:02.759 --> 15:06.080
How about we verify the handwriting?

15:10.639 --> 15:13.120
You hurt my heart

15:13.120 --> 15:15.559
and deceived me.

15:16.559 --> 15:19.320
Starting today,

15:19.320 --> 15:23.879
I, Shen Zhi Li,

15:23.879 --> 15:26.360
cut all ties with you!

15:34.080 --> 15:35.840
Gu Qin,

15:35.840 --> 15:37.600
you are fond of Shen Zhi Li,

15:37.600 --> 15:39.519
and yet you recommended her
to be the empress.

15:39.519 --> 15:42.519
What exactly are you up to?

15:43.720 --> 15:46.120
Your Majesty, that's not true.

15:46.120 --> 15:48.279
Someone must have
coveted my position of chancellor

15:48.279 --> 15:50.159
and tempted Zhi Li to set a trap to frame me,

15:50.159 --> 15:51.799
wanting to put me to death.

15:51.799 --> 15:54.000
Since you claim to be a good chancellor,

15:54.000 --> 15:56.159
let this booklet show you

15:56.159 --> 15:58.360
what you have done.

15:58.360 --> 16:00.320
Open it!

16:10.519 --> 16:12.639
Fake! It's all fake!

16:12.639 --> 16:15.799
True or not, do you think you can quibble?

16:15.799 --> 16:18.720
The birthday gift for you has also arrived.

16:23.039 --> 16:24.360
Your Majesty.

16:24.360 --> 16:27.559
I'm Dou Kou, Lady Yuan's maid.

16:27.559 --> 16:28.919
I heard Lord Gu

16:28.919 --> 16:31.200
confess his feelings to Miss Shen.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.799
I saw it with my own eyes.

16:32.799 --> 16:34.399
It was him!

16:34.399 --> 16:36.720
He

16:36.720 --> 16:37.799
stabbed my lady

16:37.799 --> 16:39.840
again and again!

16:39.840 --> 16:42.480
Sadly, she was already one month pregnant.

16:42.480 --> 16:45.840
How could he cruelly kill her?

16:45.840 --> 16:48.799
You lowly maid! Nonsense!

16:50.440 --> 16:52.080
Guards!

16:55.320 --> 16:59.200
I'm Xue Leng, a private killer of Lord Gu.

16:59.200 --> 17:02.639
Over the years, he has been threatening me
with the lives of my wife and daughter,

17:02.639 --> 17:04.920
forcing me to assassinate people.

17:04.920 --> 17:07.359
He once ordered me to kill Wan Kai,

17:07.359 --> 17:10.279
but I didn't kill Liu Ru Yan.

17:10.279 --> 17:12.480
He did it himself.

17:12.480 --> 17:16.240
Lord Gu has colluded
with Ling Yun Fei for years.

17:16.240 --> 17:18.839
You filthy rat! This is slander!

17:18.839 --> 17:22.039
I never colluded with a gang leader!

17:22.039 --> 17:25.920
Do you know
why Ling Yun Fei used to escape justice?

17:25.920 --> 17:29.160
That's because Gu Qin,
the so-called "good chancellor",

17:29.160 --> 17:32.240
always covered for him.

17:32.240 --> 17:34.680
Ling Yun Fei was his half-brother,

17:34.680 --> 17:38.000
who had long left their home.

17:38.000 --> 17:41.319
Meng Ting Hui, this is slander!

17:48.079 --> 17:51.960
Gu Qin, you used your official power
to erase household registrations,

17:51.960 --> 17:54.640
making Ling Yun Fei a shadow
that couldn't see the light.

17:54.640 --> 17:57.480
It was also you
who had Ling Yun Fei kill Lord Yuan,

17:57.480 --> 17:59.079
taking all the credit for flood control,

17:59.079 --> 18:00.200
and becoming chancellor.

18:00.200 --> 18:02.079
It was also you

18:02.079 --> 18:06.480
who had Ling Yun Fei control the officials
through female students in gambling houses

18:06.480 --> 18:10.599
and send women from Wanxiang Pavilion
to the colleagues as spies.

18:10.599 --> 18:12.480
You secured your position

18:12.480 --> 18:15.319
at the cost of the lives
of your father-in-law, your brother,

18:15.319 --> 18:17.039
your wife, and your child.

18:17.039 --> 18:19.480
Don't you feel guilty at all?

18:23.000 --> 18:25.079
Take him away.

18:34.480 --> 18:36.319
Gu Qin.

18:36.319 --> 18:40.599
The evidence is solid.
It's time to plead guilty.

18:51.759 --> 18:53.480
Plead guilty?

18:55.039 --> 18:56.839
Why should I?

18:58.039 --> 19:01.480
Lord Yuan could only
write unrealistic policy essays in his room.

19:01.480 --> 19:03.839
With a stroke of his brush,
he took all the glory.

19:03.839 --> 19:05.599
Why?

19:05.599 --> 19:08.079
I killed Lord Yuan,

19:08.079 --> 19:10.960
but in return, I achieved ten years of peace
for the seven prefectures.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.519
Isn't that worth it?

19:12.519 --> 19:14.039
All these court officials

19:14.039 --> 19:16.079
have ever had colleagues' blood
on their hands.

19:16.079 --> 19:17.559
Why should I plead guilty?

19:17.559 --> 19:21.720
Hundreds of thousands of soldiers
achieved peace for the seven prefectures.

19:21.720 --> 19:24.119
How dare you take credit for it!

19:24.119 --> 19:28.000
Gu Qin,
you claim you do it all for the people,

19:28.000 --> 19:30.799
but you never cared about their well-being.

19:30.799 --> 19:34.839
You pave your path to glory
with the blood of others!

19:34.839 --> 19:38.720
Meng Ting Hui, yes, you're upright.

19:38.720 --> 19:40.680
Everyone likes you.

19:40.680 --> 19:45.480
Now you can take the moral high ground
and accuse me and despise me.

19:46.759 --> 19:49.799
But who knows how difficult my path has been?

19:49.799 --> 19:52.799
I was born into a humble family,
with no power or influence.

19:52.799 --> 19:54.839
Anyone could trample over my dignity.

19:54.839 --> 19:58.799
The late emperor only saw Lord Yuan, Xu Ting,

19:58.799 --> 20:01.359
and a few old-timers like Shen Wu Chen.

20:01.359 --> 20:02.759
I endured ten long years

20:02.759 --> 20:05.400
and finally waited for Your Majesty
to ascend the throne.

20:05.400 --> 20:08.559
But you actually want
to replace old officials with new ones.

20:08.559 --> 20:11.279
Now even a woman looks down on me.

20:11.279 --> 20:13.920
If I don't kill those who stand in my way,
what can I do then?

20:13.920 --> 20:16.960
There are quite a few court officials
with humble roots.

20:16.960 --> 20:20.720
You attribute your greed,
ambition, and malice

20:20.720 --> 20:23.799
to others and to this world.

20:23.799 --> 20:25.400
Fine.

20:25.400 --> 20:30.200
Today, let the entire country see
how despicable and disgraceful you are!

20:35.319 --> 20:36.960
That's right.

20:38.759 --> 20:41.039
I am despicable,

20:41.039 --> 20:42.680
disgraceful.

20:43.680 --> 20:46.920
All I want is to climb high,

20:46.920 --> 20:51.720
one step and another,

20:51.720 --> 20:54.440
till I climb my way to the peak of power!

20:54.440 --> 20:55.920
I want to become the second most powerful man

20:55.920 --> 20:58.480
in this country!

21:01.079 --> 21:05.640
I have endured so many years for this day

21:05.640 --> 21:08.279
and killed so many people.

21:08.279 --> 21:10.920
Why can't you just let me get my way?

21:10.920 --> 21:14.000
How could you have such an absurd idea?

21:14.000 --> 21:17.720
How can you turn your grievances
into a reason to kill others?

21:17.720 --> 21:19.559
You tramp!

21:21.079 --> 21:23.480
Even you look down on me?

21:24.240 --> 21:26.480
You're just like Yuan Ling Yi,

21:26.480 --> 21:30.039
relying on family background
to despise and accuse me.

21:34.720 --> 21:37.200
Is this your great grace?

21:37.200 --> 21:39.519
Is this a commendation banquet?

21:39.519 --> 21:43.480
You purposely set me up, Your Majesty!

21:44.880 --> 21:47.920
I have been loyal to the country all my life.

21:49.640 --> 21:53.960
- The Ning Empire failed me!
- How dare you speak of loyalty!

21:57.759 --> 22:01.119
You have been blinded by power.

22:01.119 --> 22:04.000
You colluded with the Blood Moon Society
and gave away the military deployment map.

22:04.000 --> 22:06.440
You have long betrayed the country!

22:07.440 --> 22:10.039
The evidence is conclusive.

22:10.039 --> 22:12.079
Gu Qin, the Right Chancellor,

22:12.079 --> 22:14.200
shall be immediately dismissed.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.839
Exterminate three generations of his family

22:15.839 --> 22:18.960
and announce his crimes to the nation

22:18.960 --> 22:20.640
as a warning to others.

22:20.640 --> 22:22.160
Take him away!

22:27.240 --> 22:31.160
Meng Ting Hui, I will kill you!

22:36.400 --> 22:39.079
You made me do it all! I am innocent!

22:39.079 --> 22:40.720
I am a hero of flood control!

22:40.720 --> 22:42.160
You made me do it all!

22:42.160 --> 22:47.039
Gu Qin, the court's judgment
is not the end of your life.

22:47.039 --> 22:49.799
As a "good chancellor",

22:49.799 --> 22:51.680
you should face the judgment of the people.

22:51.680 --> 22:52.720
I am innocent!

22:52.720 --> 22:56.000
Your Majesty, I'm a hero of flood control!
I am innocent!

22:56.000 --> 22:57.720
- Take him away.
- I'm a hero of flood control!

22:57.720 --> 23:00.920
I am innocent! I am a hero of flood control!

23:00.920 --> 23:05.119
Let me go! I am a hero of flood control!

23:29.039 --> 23:31.079
Zhi Li, you are very brave.

23:31.079 --> 23:33.039
If you want to cry, just do it.

23:33.039 --> 23:34.759
Meng,

23:35.559 --> 23:37.559
whenever I close my eyes,

23:37.559 --> 23:41.160
I see the moment he gave me the love lock.

23:41.160 --> 23:44.200
He looked gentle.

23:46.920 --> 23:49.480
It was just a big lie orchestrated by him.

23:49.480 --> 23:51.680
I hate him,

23:51.680 --> 23:53.839
but I hate myself even more.

23:53.839 --> 23:56.319
It's his fault, not yours.

23:56.319 --> 23:59.000
What you did today required great courage.

23:59.000 --> 24:01.519
Very few people can do it.

24:06.960 --> 24:09.839
Everything can start anew.

24:09.839 --> 24:14.039
Zhi Li, your battlefield
doesn't lie in romantic love,

24:14.039 --> 24:15.559
but in the Censorate,

24:15.559 --> 24:17.359
in the official documents,

24:17.359 --> 24:20.000
and in the hearts of the people.

24:20.000 --> 24:22.079
I will be with you.

24:34.039 --> 24:36.920
It's cold. Don't catch a chill.

24:40.599 --> 24:42.839
I want to walk alone for a while.

25:06.208 --> 25:09.680
[Petition Umbrella]

25:12.224 --> 25:16.340
[Petition Umbrella]

25:51.119 --> 25:54.880
I am the best chancellor of Ning Empire.

25:55.960 --> 25:57.279
Flood control.

25:57.279 --> 25:58.799
Quelling rebellions.

25:58.799 --> 26:01.400
Digging canals.

26:01.400 --> 26:04.559
I single-handedly created a prosperous era.

26:06.599 --> 26:08.440
Meng Ting Hui!

26:08.440 --> 26:12.240
Look at the people.

26:12.240 --> 26:15.039
Look at how much they adore me!

26:15.039 --> 26:17.640
Meng Ting Hui, look!

26:17.640 --> 26:19.180
Look at the people!

26:20.061 --> 26:23.240
Look at how much they adore me!

26:23.240 --> 26:25.599
You must all remember me.

26:25.599 --> 26:28.200
I am the best chancellor of Ning Empire.

26:28.200 --> 26:33.160
I'm Gu Qin.

26:47.200 --> 26:50.880
I'm Gu Qin,
the best chancellor of Ning Empire.

26:52.480 --> 26:56.079
You should all support me.

26:56.680 --> 26:59.200
I'm a hero of flood control!

26:59.200 --> 27:02.839
I'm Gu Qin, the hero of flood control!

27:06.279 --> 27:09.039
A dam broke!

27:09.039 --> 27:11.559
Look! People are dying!

27:11.559 --> 27:15.279
Quick, follow me to fight the flood!

27:25.319 --> 27:28.160
Go carry sandbags to plug the breach!

27:28.160 --> 27:31.920
Come on! Carry sandbags!

27:31.920 --> 27:35.440
With me, the flood cannot harm anyone.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.880
I am a hero of flood control!

27:37.880 --> 27:40.519
I am a hero of flood control!

27:42.519 --> 27:44.359
I am a hero of flood control!

27:44.359 --> 27:46.079
I am...

28:39.480 --> 28:40.680
My lord.

28:40.680 --> 28:44.200
Gu Qin has passed away.

28:44.839 --> 28:46.480
He went mad

28:46.480 --> 28:49.160
and drowned himself in the river.

28:49.160 --> 28:54.240
He controlled the waters
and ultimately died in water.

28:54.240 --> 28:56.880
It is indeed the cycle of justice.

28:56.880 --> 28:59.920
Anyway, he was a Right Chancellor.

28:59.920 --> 29:03.519
Director Meng burned the petition umbrella
in the street,

29:03.519 --> 29:05.359
adding fuel to the fire.

29:05.359 --> 29:07.359
The incensed people all watched

29:07.359 --> 29:09.480
how insane and disgraceful Gu Qin was.

29:09.480 --> 29:12.319
How long has Meng Ting Hui been working
in the court?

29:12.319 --> 29:15.039
It has been over three years, my lord.

29:15.039 --> 29:18.160
In these three years, she has acted extremely

29:18.160 --> 29:19.759
and stopped at nothing,

29:19.759 --> 29:21.720
causing turmoil in the court

29:21.720 --> 29:23.759
and loosening the laws.

29:23.759 --> 29:26.400
Although Gu Qin deserves to die,

29:26.400 --> 29:29.599
what he said makes sense.

29:29.599 --> 29:32.880
Now, the new officials are rising,

29:32.880 --> 29:34.759
and the old ones are being snubbed.

29:34.759 --> 29:37.880
I have served three emperors.

29:37.880 --> 29:40.880
Standing at the current court,

29:43.480 --> 29:46.960
I find it utterly unfamiliar.

30:02.000 --> 30:03.000
[Shen Mansion]

30:03.000 --> 30:04.400
Master,

30:04.400 --> 30:07.400
you shouldn't play dumb anymore.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.880
Zhi Li used to be so glorious.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.960
She was the candidate for empress.

30:11.960 --> 30:14.200
Now, the entire capital knows

30:14.200 --> 30:15.759
she met Lord Gu in secret at night

30:15.759 --> 30:19.039
and had an ambiguous relationship
with her teacher.

30:21.160 --> 30:24.160
Cousin, I'm your close relative.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.880
Naturally, I want what's best for Zhi Li.

30:25.880 --> 30:28.799
My nephew is about the same age as Zhi Li,

30:28.799 --> 30:31.160
and he is a scholar.

30:31.160 --> 30:34.480
His wife died of illness two years ago,
and he hasn't remarried.

30:34.480 --> 30:37.640
While he's still willing to marry,
just let Zhi Li marry him.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.720
Zhi Li will never ruin her own life

30:38.720 --> 30:41.759
because of rumors.

30:41.759 --> 30:44.000
Her marriage is her own decision.

30:44.000 --> 30:45.519
Even if she never marries,

30:45.519 --> 30:47.039
we are willing to support her.

30:47.039 --> 30:49.599
So don't trouble yourself.

30:49.599 --> 30:52.599
The tea is cold. Please leave.

30:56.960 --> 30:58.720
Master,

30:58.720 --> 31:02.160
your family now is not what it used to be.

31:02.160 --> 31:04.160
The whole city is spreading rumors

31:04.160 --> 31:07.640
that Zhi Li knew long ago
that Gu Qin killed his wife and child,

31:07.640 --> 31:09.079
and they also say she was an accomplice.

31:09.079 --> 31:10.119
If it's true,

31:10.119 --> 31:13.759
your entire family would be executed.

31:13.759 --> 31:15.880
That demon Gu Qin killed all his family,

31:15.880 --> 31:18.440
and Zhi Li was the one
who personally brought him to justice.

31:18.440 --> 31:20.960
How could she become an accomplice?

31:21.680 --> 31:23.680
If you talk nonsense again,

31:23.680 --> 31:25.319
I'll punch you out!

31:25.319 --> 31:27.599
You're so ungrateful.

31:27.599 --> 31:28.759
Fine, just wait.

31:28.759 --> 31:31.519
Sooner or later,
your entire family will be ruined by Zhi Li.

31:31.519 --> 31:33.119
Get out!

31:34.920 --> 31:35.920
Fine!

31:35.920 --> 31:38.240
I will never come again even if you beg me.

31:40.759 --> 31:45.960
At the banquet,
when Zhi Li exposed that bad guy,

31:45.960 --> 31:48.480
I thought she was just hurt by love,

31:48.480 --> 31:53.000
but now it seems
she was proving her innocence.

31:53.000 --> 31:55.920
Now, the capital is full of rumors.

31:55.920 --> 31:59.559
How can Zhi Li take it?

31:59.559 --> 32:03.680
From now on,
whoever says Zhi Li is an accomplice,

32:03.680 --> 32:08.160
I will risk my reputation

32:08.160 --> 32:09.920
to fight them to the death.

32:09.920 --> 32:12.119
That's right.

32:12.119 --> 32:14.079
Whatever it takes,

32:14.079 --> 32:15.920
we must protect Zhi Li.

32:15.920 --> 32:18.000
If she wants to work cases,
we'll back her up.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.759
If she wants to hide,
we'll take her under our wings.

32:19.759 --> 32:22.200
We will never let anyone hurt her.

32:33.599 --> 32:37.039
Child, be patient.

32:37.039 --> 32:40.599
After the Laba Festival,
it's the Spring Festival.

32:40.599 --> 32:43.640
Have Laba porridge for a few days

32:43.640 --> 32:47.619
till the twenty-third day
of the twelfth lunar month.

32:47.619 --> 32:49.559
[Shen Mansion]

32:50.759 --> 32:53.960
Every Laba Festival,
the house was always full of guests,

32:53.960 --> 32:56.200
and the Grand Tutor was extremely busy.

32:56.200 --> 32:57.960
Today, at this hour,

32:57.960 --> 33:00.400
there isn't even a single guest coming.

33:00.400 --> 33:02.200
Because of what just happened,

33:02.200 --> 33:04.440
those court officials all avoid us.

33:04.440 --> 33:06.200
But Director Meng said

33:06.200 --> 33:08.559
that it was Gu Qin
who deceived our young lady?

33:08.559 --> 33:11.519
But people gossip.

33:14.200 --> 33:16.119
My lady.

33:29.319 --> 33:34.240
Today is Laba Festival.
Wish Father and Mother happiness and health.

33:34.240 --> 33:37.359
Good child, Zhi Li, sit down.

33:37.359 --> 33:39.960
We are family, no need to be formal.

33:48.519 --> 33:52.160
Where is Nian? Why isn't he here?

33:53.200 --> 33:56.839
Captain Di has gone out and not returned yet.

33:59.559 --> 34:02.079
What about Zhi Shu?

34:02.079 --> 34:06.319
He's been gone so long without even a letter.

34:06.319 --> 34:09.000
He has always loved festivals.

34:09.000 --> 34:11.039
This winter is cold.

34:11.039 --> 34:14.599
I fear he can't take good care of himself.

34:14.599 --> 34:16.960
Children have their own things to do.

34:17.639 --> 34:21.960
They've all grown up
and will be independent sooner or later.

34:21.960 --> 34:24.800
Let's eat. The food is getting cold.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.639
Let's eat.

34:31.519 --> 34:33.019
Go ahead.

34:34.159 --> 34:35.679
Try this.

34:42.760 --> 34:45.440
You've been resting at home for so many days.

34:45.440 --> 34:48.559
When do you plan to get back to work?

34:48.559 --> 34:53.320
After the festival, I will go back
to the Censorate.

34:53.320 --> 34:56.960
I will be strict with myself.

34:56.960 --> 34:59.679
Before, I misjudged people

34:59.679 --> 35:01.880
and brought shame to our family.

35:01.880 --> 35:05.119
Zhi Li, we allowed you to become an official,

35:05.119 --> 35:08.400
hoping you could establish yourself
through your talent,

35:08.400 --> 35:11.159
instead of being trapped by romantic love.

35:11.159 --> 35:18.519
Now, don't let any gossip break your pride.

35:18.519 --> 35:20.000
Your father is right.

35:20.000 --> 35:24.920
We never allowed you
to read books on disciplining women

35:24.920 --> 35:29.599
precisely because we didn't want
to constrain your nature.

35:29.599 --> 35:33.239
The other day, your father acted impulsively.

35:33.239 --> 35:34.880
Eat.

35:37.320 --> 35:40.679
Master, Madam, a guest came.

35:52.280 --> 35:55.239
Grand Tutor Shen, Madam Shen,

35:55.239 --> 35:58.840
wish you both happiness and health.

36:00.199 --> 36:02.519
Thank you, Director Meng.

36:02.519 --> 36:06.760
Master, I didn't come as Director.

36:06.760 --> 36:08.519
His Majesty wanted to come,

36:08.519 --> 36:10.880
but he said that given the current situation,

36:10.880 --> 36:14.000
if he could not come to dine with you,

36:14.000 --> 36:16.039
he would feel uneasy.

36:16.039 --> 36:17.800
But if he came in person,

36:17.800 --> 36:20.559
it would put your family
right at the center of the storm.

36:20.559 --> 36:24.000
So His Majesty ordered me
to visit on his behalf.

36:24.000 --> 36:25.679
His Majesty...

36:27.760 --> 36:29.800
I am unworthy of such grace.

36:29.800 --> 36:31.119
His Majesty also said

36:31.119 --> 36:35.199
he would have porridge in the palace
together with your family

36:35.199 --> 36:37.199
to celebrate this festival.

36:38.199 --> 36:43.679
I appreciate it, Your Majesty.

36:53.800 --> 36:55.519
I've conveyed the messages for His Majesty,

36:55.519 --> 36:58.079
but my personal wish is not yet fulfilled.

36:58.079 --> 37:01.480
I was worried about Zhi Li,
so I came uninvited.

37:01.480 --> 37:05.480
I wish to spend this festival with you.
Is that alright?

37:05.480 --> 37:07.039
It's so kind of you.

37:07.039 --> 37:08.320
You are like our family.

37:08.320 --> 37:10.239
We are happy to have you here.

37:10.239 --> 37:12.159
When Fu Zhi returns,

37:12.159 --> 37:13.880
I'll bring her here.

37:13.880 --> 37:15.199
Great.

37:15.199 --> 37:18.000
Then you have to cook

37:18.000 --> 37:20.760
and treat the two children well.

37:23.599 --> 37:25.199
Alright.

37:30.719 --> 37:33.760
Zhi Li, come back to work soon.

37:33.760 --> 37:35.239
Without you,

37:35.239 --> 37:38.960
the tea in the Censorate has no flavor.

37:40.239 --> 37:41.840
Okay.

37:45.679 --> 37:47.400
Nian.

37:49.840 --> 37:52.079
What is this about?

37:53.159 --> 37:57.039
Today, I will move out of the house.

38:00.960 --> 38:04.119
Father, Mother,

38:04.119 --> 38:08.079
when my father died for the country,

38:08.079 --> 38:09.679
I was little.

38:09.679 --> 38:11.280
His Majesty wanted me to inherit his title,

38:11.280 --> 38:13.480
but I felt I didn't deserve it.

38:13.480 --> 38:16.679
Now I have come of age
and achieved some small merits,

38:16.679 --> 38:19.800
so today I asked His Majesty for the title.

38:19.800 --> 38:22.599
I'm moving out of the house
to establish my own household.

38:22.599 --> 38:27.280
Now, I'll formally propose a marriage.

38:27.280 --> 38:29.920
I wish to marry Shen Zhi Li.

38:34.960 --> 38:38.679
What? Nian, why are you suddenly proposing?

38:38.679 --> 38:41.000
You two are siblings!

38:41.000 --> 38:43.519
But we are not blood-related.

38:43.519 --> 38:44.719
I call you Father and Mother

38:44.719 --> 38:47.079
because you kindly raised me.

38:47.079 --> 38:49.559
Now, there is much gossip in the court,

38:49.559 --> 38:51.719
but the Privy Council remains quiet

38:51.719 --> 38:55.159
because the veteran generals there
were once my father's subordinates.

38:55.159 --> 38:56.960
If Zhi Li marries me,

38:56.960 --> 38:58.800
they will speak up for the Shen family.

38:58.800 --> 39:02.400
And no one will slander Zhi Li
and the Shen family.

39:02.400 --> 39:05.920
Nian, we appreciate your kindness,

39:05.920 --> 39:07.800
but this is a matter of your marriage.

39:07.800 --> 39:11.079
How can you decide hastily
because of our family's crisis?

39:11.079 --> 39:14.960
Today, His Majesty sent Director Meng here

39:14.960 --> 39:16.920
to tell the whole country

39:16.920 --> 39:20.000
that His Majesty stands with the Shen family.

39:20.000 --> 39:23.159
The outside criticism will surely subside.

39:23.159 --> 39:24.519
Good child,

39:24.519 --> 39:27.880
marriage is a big matter.
We cannot let you sacrifice it.

39:27.880 --> 39:30.440
You should marry someone you truly love.

39:30.440 --> 39:33.239
Get up.

39:36.119 --> 39:40.440
Father, I have long fallen for Zhi Li.

39:41.519 --> 39:45.199
Zhi Li is like a precious treasure
in my heart.

39:45.199 --> 39:48.199
I cannot watch people judge her at all.

39:48.199 --> 39:51.400
I established my own household
because I want to give her the best.

39:51.400 --> 39:53.039
I know

39:53.039 --> 39:55.679
it's still not enough to prove my sincerity.

39:55.679 --> 40:00.199
So I accept any test you set for me.

40:05.559 --> 40:07.360
Nian,

40:08.320 --> 40:10.840
I watched you grow up.

40:10.840 --> 40:13.880
You have always had courage and principles.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.400
Although you are young,

40:15.400 --> 40:19.880
you have always been steady
in speech and action.

40:25.039 --> 40:29.119
But this time,

40:29.119 --> 40:31.360
I won't arrange Zhi Li's marriage.

40:31.360 --> 40:35.599
Zhi Li chooses her own husband.
